Package: eitaas-linux
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3, freerdp3-x11, opensc, pcscd, pcsc-tools, libccid, libpcsclite1
Description: community Linux helper for EITaaS Azure Virtual Desktop
 Provides read-only diagnostics, protected RDPW profile handling, smart-card
 checks, and safe FreeRDP client selection. A FreeRDP 3 build with AAD and
 PC/SC support is required for connections.
